---
// 5 Reasons First Aid Training is Essential Section
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="why-first-aid" class="relative isolate bg-background text-foreground py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:tl2gsl">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:dzr32">
      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-4 reveal" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:jvarhw">
        5 Reasons Learning First Aid is Important for Anyone to Know
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed reveal reveal-delay-1" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:63vjwa">
        Whether for your workplace team, healthcare facility, or household, proper emergency first aid training builds life-saving confidence.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Process Cards Rail -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:dzr33">
      <!-- 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm reveal" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1at3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-subtle text-primary-foreground font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4 border border-amber-200" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1at2">
          1
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:56vua7">First Aid Saves Lives</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:63vjwb">
          Based on a Red Cross survey, over half of deaths can be prevented if more people knew first aid.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm reveal reveal-delay-1" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1at1">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-subtle text-primary-foreground font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4 border border-amber-200" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1at0">
          2
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:56vua8">Reduce Recovery Time</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:63vjwc">
          Early intervention with proper first aid care can mean the difference between a quick or long recovery. Simple first aid techniques could keep an injury from becoming worse. For example, you can slow down the bleeding on a deep cut to prevent severe blood loss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm reveal reveal-delay-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1asz">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-subtle text-primary-foreground font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4 border border-amber-200" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1asy">
          3
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:56vua9">Prioritize Injuries</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:63vjwd">
          First aid training will give you the knowledge needed to treat the most pressing injuries first.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm reveal reveal-delay-1" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1asx">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-subtle text-primary-foreground font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4 border border-amber-200" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1asw">
          4
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:56vuaa">Save a Trip to the Hospital</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:63vjwe">
          You will know if a trip to the hospital is really necessary or if the injury would be better managed at home with proper bandaging and ice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5 (Spanning 2 cols on lg) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-border hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm reveal reveal-delay-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1asv">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-subtle text-primary-foreground font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4 border border-amber-200" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:2a1asu">
          5
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:56vuab">Keep Your Family Safe</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/WhyFirstAid.astro:63vjx0">
          You will find a new sense of confidence once you have proper first aid training. You can keep your kids and even yourself safer with an increased sense of awareness and knowledge of first aid procedures.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
